Z||000000||wahoo4u||12-02-2000||01:11 PM||||I was flipping through some of my fiero material and came across a book that i didn't know i had.  It was released in 1989 to all 1984 fiero owners.  Its subject was on the recall.  Told of the recall in 1987 for 1984 fieros with engine fires.  Said what should be done, noises possible noticed, and wierd guage activity showing a possible problem.  The book is strickly for the 84 fiero.  I have never seen a book like this.  Is it fairly uncommon to still be in existance?  We are the third if not fourth owner of the car and are working on fixing it up.  Had not ran for a few years.  Also in the car was a revised maintance scheldule.  How many people still have these books, or have seen them?  Kinda curious about the rarity of them.  ||||reg||1
